# NOTE: soundfonts are deliberately NOT tracked with Git LFS.
#
# Vercel (like Netlify and Cloudflare Pages) clones the repository without
# resolving LFS objects, so LFS-tracked binaries deploy as ~133-byte pointer
# stubs and the synthesizer receives text instead of audio. The nine keyboard
# banks in public/assets/soundfonts are committed as ordinary binary files.
*.sf2 -text
*.sf3 -text

# Normalise line endings for source so Windows/macOS collaborators don't churn diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.tsx  text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
